#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:7
msgid "About · How to contribute"
msgstr "बारेमा · कसरी योगदान गर्ने"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:9
msgid "A practical path from finding public-interest work to leaving a visible record of what changed. DevNepal is the registry and collaboration layer; code stays on GitHub."
msgstr "सार्वजनिक हितको काम भेट्टाएदेखि के परिवर्तन भयो भन्ने देखिने अभिलेख राख्नेसम्मको व्यावहारिक बाटो।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:10
msgid "Find a fit · Read before acting · Close the loop through the project’s published route."
msgstr "उपयुक्तता खोज्नुहोस् · कार्य गर्नुअघि पढ्नुहोस् · परियोजनाको प्रकाशित मार्गबाट प्रक्रिया पूरा गर्नुहोस्।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:15
msgid "01 · The process"
msgstr "०१ · प्रक्रिया"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:16
msgid "From a published listing to a recognised contribution"
msgstr "प्रकाशित सूचीबाट मान्यता प्राप्त योगदानसम्म"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:17
msgid "Three steps, each with a named party answerable for it. Nothing on this platform is published, opened or recognised without one."
msgstr "तीन चरण, प्रत्येकका लागि एक नामित पक्ष उत्तरदायी हुन्छ। यस मञ्चमा कुनै पनि कुरा त्यस्तो पक्षविना प्रकाशित, खुला वा मान्यता प्राप्त हुँदैन।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:19
msgid "A ministry lists a project"
msgstr "मन्त्रालयले परियोजना सूचीबद्ध गर्छ"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:19
msgid "A named publisher documents the contribution route, public safeguards, and maintainer responsibility before publication."
msgstr "प्रकाशनअघि नामित प्रकाशकले योगदान मार्ग, सार्वजनिक सुरक्षा उपाय र मर्मतकर्ताको जिम्मेवारी दस्तावेज गर्छ।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:20
msgid "You contribute"
msgstr "तपाईं योगदान गर्नुहुन्छ"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:20
msgid "Apply when a workstream is controlled, or follow the published direct-contribution instructions for an open task."
msgstr "कार्यधारा नियन्त्रित भएमा आवेदन दिनुहोस्, वा प्रकाशित प्रत्यक्ष-योगदान निर्देशन पालना गर्नुहोस्।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:21
msgid "Work is verified and recognised"
msgstr "काम प्रमाणित र मान्यता प्राप्त हुन्छ"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:21
msgid "A maintainer reviews the evidence and records a reasoned decision; raw activity alone is not recognition."
msgstr "मेन्टेनर वा अधिकृत समीक्षकले प्रमाण जाँचेर कारणसहित निर्णय अभिलेख गर्छ। आफैं बुझाएको दाबी मात्र आधिकारिक सम्मान हुँदैन।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:26
msgid "02 · Scope and limits"
msgstr "०२ · दायरा र सीमा"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:27
msgid "What DevNepal is — and is not"
msgstr "देवनेपाल के हो — र के होइन"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:28
msgid "Read both columns before you invest time in a listing. The left column is what the platform checks; the right is what it deliberately leaves to the project."
msgstr "कुनै सूचीमा समय लगाउनुअघि दुवै स्तम्भ पढ्नुहोस्। बायाँ स्तम्भ मञ्चले जाँच्ने कुरा हो; दायाँ स्तम्भ मञ्चले जानाजान परियोजनालाई छाड्ने कुरा हो।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:31
msgid "What DevNepal verifies"
msgstr "देवनेपालले के प्रमाणित गर्छ"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:33
msgid "Government projects have an accountable ministry publisher, maintainer, suitability review, and contribution guidance before publication."
msgstr "सरकारी परियोजनामा प्रकाशनअघि जवाफदेही मन्त्रालय प्रकाशक, मेन्टेनर, उपयुक्तता समीक्षा र योगदान निर्देशन हुन्छ।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:34
msgid "Accepted contributions retain a visible evidence and decision trail; raw activity is not treated as impact by itself."
msgstr "स्वीकृत योगदानले देखिने प्रमाण र निर्णय अभिलेख राख्छ; कच्चा गतिविधिलाई मात्र प्रभाव मानिँदैन।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:38
msgid "What DevNepal does not promise"
msgstr "देवनेपालले के प्रतिज्ञा गर्दैन"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:40
msgid "A listing is not an employment offer, procurement commitment, or guarantee that a contribution will be merged."
msgstr "सूचीकरण रोजगारी प्रस्ताव, खरिद प्रतिबद्धता वा योगदान मर्ज हुने ग्यारेन्टी होइन।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:41
msgid "DevNepal is not a code host; branches, issues, pull requests, and CI remain with the project’s repository."
msgstr "DevNepal कोड होस्ट होइन; शाखा, इशु, पुल रिक्वेस्ट र CI परियोजनाको रिपोजिटरीमै रहन्छन्।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:48
msgid "03 · Policies"
msgstr "०३ · नीतिहरू"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:49
msgid "Safety and reporting"
msgstr "सुरक्षा र रिपोर्टिङ"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:51
#: apps/projects/templates/projects/project_detail.html:157
msgid "Security and reporting"
msgstr "सुरक्षा र प्रतिवेदन"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:51
msgid "Confidential route available"
msgstr "गोप्य मार्ग उपलब्ध छ"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:53
msgid "Follow the community code of conduct, keep private or security-sensitive details out of public project pages, and use the confidential report form when something needs review."
msgstr "समुदायको आचारसंहिता पालना गर्नुहोस्, निजी वा सुरक्षा-संवेदनशील विवरण सार्वजनिक परियोजना पृष्ठमा नराख्नुहोस्, र समीक्षा आवश्यक परे गोप्य रिपोर्ट फारम प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:56
msgid "Report content confidentially"
msgstr "सामग्री गोप्य रूपमा रिपोर्ट गर्नुहोस्"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:57
msgid "Reports reach the moderation queue, not the project’s public page. Filing one needs a signed-in account."
msgstr "प्रतिवेदन परियोजनाको सार्वजनिक पृष्ठमा होइन, मध्यस्थता सूचीमा पुग्छ। प्रतिवेदन दर्ता गर्न साइन इन गरिएको खाता चाहिन्छ।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:63
msgid "04 · Frequently asked"
msgstr "०४ · बारम्बार सोधिने"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:64
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:67
msgid "How are contributions verified?"
msgstr "योगदान कसरी प्रमाणित हुन्छ?"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:68
msgid "A maintainer or authorised reviewer checks the evidence and records a reasoned decision. A self-submitted claim is not official recognition by itself."
msgstr "मेन्टेनर वा अधिकृत समीक्षकले प्रमाण जाँचेर कारणसहित निर्णय अभिलेख गर्छ। आफैं बुझाएको दाबी मात्र आधिकारिक सम्मान हुँदैन।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:71
msgid "What should I do if a project is not a fit?"
msgstr "परियोजना आफूलाई नमिलेमा के गर्ने?"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:72
msgid "Do not submit sensitive material. Read the brief, use the stated contact path, or choose another project whose scope and response expectations fit your time."
msgstr "संवेदनशील सामग्री नबुझाउनुहोस्। विवरण पढ्नुहोस्, तोकिएको सम्पर्क माध्यम प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्, वा आफ्नो समयसँग मिल्ने अर्को परियोजना छान्नुहोस्।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:75
msgid "Do I need a DevNepal account to contribute?"
msgstr "योगदान गर्न DevNepal खाता चाहिन्छ?"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:76
msgid "No. Contributions are made and reviewed on the project’s own repository; only ministry publishers sign in here."
msgstr "पर्दैन। योगदान परियोजनाकै रिपोजिटोरीमा गरिन्छ र त्यहीँ पुनरावलोकन हुन्छ; यहाँ मन्त्रालयका प्रकाशकमात्र साइन इन गर्छन्।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:82
msgid "05 · Where to start"
msgstr "०५ · कहाँबाट सुरु गर्ने"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:83
msgid "Choose where to start"
msgstr "कहाँबाट सुरु गर्ने छान्नुहोस्"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:84
msgid "Use the route that matches your intent, then read the project’s own brief before contacting a maintainer."
msgstr "आफ्नो उद्देश्यसँग मिल्ने बाटो रोज्नुहोस् र मेन्टेनरलाई सम्पर्क गर्नुअघि परियोजनाको विवरण पढ्नुहोस्।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:89
msgid "Ministry-published work with a named publisher, an approved listing, and a stated response expectation."
msgstr "नामित प्रकाशक, स्वीकृत सूची र उल्लिखित प्रतिक्रिया अपेक्षासहितको मन्त्रालयद्वारा प्रकाशित काम।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:95
msgid "Current GitHub issues from published government projects, ready to inspect without a DevNepal account."
msgstr "प्रकाशित सरकारी परियोजनाका हालका GitHub मुद्दाहरू DevNepal खाता नखोली हेर्न सकिन्छ।"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:102
msgid "06 · Support"
msgstr "०६ · सहयोग"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:103
msgid "Support and next steps"
msgstr "सहयोग र अर्को चरण"

#: apps/projects/templates/projects/about.html:104
msgid "For account, safety, or moderation questions, use the relevant signed-in workflow or confidential report form so the right record is created."
msgstr "परियोजनाको विवरण र प्रकाशित योगदान मार्गबाट सुरु गर्नुहोस्। खाता, सुरक्षा वा मध्यस्थता प्रश्नका लागि सम्बन्धित लगइन गरिएको कार्यप्रवाह वा गोप्य रिपोर्ट फारम प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्।"

