#: apps/projects/views.py:228
msgid "Trust and safety"
msgstr "विश्वास र सुरक्षा"

#: apps/projects/views.py:231
msgid "DevNepal is a public-service collaboration space. Participation must remain respectful, specific, and safe for contributors and government staff."
msgstr "DevNepal सार्वजनिक सेवाका लागि सहकार्य गर्ने मञ्च हो। सहभागिता योगदानकर्ता र सरकारी कर्मचारीका लागि सम्मानजनक, स्पष्ट र सुरक्षित रहनुपर्छ।"

#: apps/projects/views.py:236
msgid "Expected conduct"
msgstr "अपेक्षित परिणाम"

#: apps/projects/views.py:238
msgid "Discuss the work, not the person. Respect privacy, accessibility needs, language choice, and the published contribution process."
msgstr "व्यक्तिको होइन, कामको विषयमा छलफल गर्नुहोस्। गोपनीयता, पहुँचयोग्यताका आवश्यकता, भाषाको छनोट र प्रकाशित योगदान प्रक्रियाको सम्मान गर्नुहोस्।"

#: apps/projects/views.py:243
msgid "Unacceptable conduct"
msgstr "अस्वीकार्य आचरण"

#: apps/projects/views.py:245
msgid "Harassment, discrimination, threats, doxxing, credential sharing, and publishing personal or restricted government data are prohibited."
msgstr "उत्पीडन, भेदभाव, धम्की, डक्सिङ, प्रमाणपत्र साझा गर्नु र व्यक्तिगत वा प्रतिबन्धित सरकारी डाटा प्रकाशित गर्नु निषेधित छ।"

#: apps/projects/views.py:250
msgid "Reporting"
